abstract: |
  This monograph evaluates the highest-leverage fields for independent researchers
  operating with zero budget and legacy hardware. Using a multiplicative
  non-compensatory gate model with 10 weighted criteria, we evaluate 18 candidate
  disciplines and recommend Formal Mathematics and Interactive Proof Formalization
  in Lean 4 / mathlib as the optimal field for maximizing durable, credential-agnostic
  public recognition. The recommendation rests on five structural pillars:
  credential elimination, AI synergy, compounding library capital, hardware compliance,
  and transferability to adjacent disciplines.
